    <string-array name="calm_story">
        <item>%1$s, today we take it slow.</item>
        <item>Trees pass by the window one by one. A light breeze.</item>
        <item>A small stream runs beside the road, water rolling over the stones.</item>
        <item>On a far hill there is a house, smoke rising slowly from the chimney.</item>
        <item>The sun warms your back, and your eyes are half closed.</item>
        <item>We are not in a hurry. At the next stop we will drink some water and walk a little.</item>
        <item>The road bends gently, and the car follows quietly.</item>
        <item>You are doing well. Just a little further.</item>
    </string-array>

